AltoVesting::rescueVestingTokens
├── when contract is not paused
│   └── it should revert with AltoVestingNotPaused
├── when contract is paused
│   ├── given contract has zero token balance
│   │   ├── it should not transfer any tokens
│   │   ├── it should not emit RescueVestingTokens event
│   │   └── it should complete successfully
│   └── given contract has non-zero token balance
│       ├── it should transfer all tokens to owner
│       ├── it should emit RescueVestingTokens event with correct parameters
│       ├── it should set contract token balance to zero
│       └── it should complete successfully
└── when caller is not owner
    ├── given contract is paused
    │   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
    └── given contract is not paused
        └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
